{{Term/Store|Flame Guard||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
Flame Guard is an [[Added Effect]] that prevents [[Link]] from taking damage due to [[Scorching Climate]]s. Some environments require a higher Effect level. This Effect does not affect damage taken from [[Extremely Hot Zone]]s, [[Fire]], Fire-based attacks, or [[Lava]], and it has a maximum potency of level two. Flame Guard also does not prevent wooden [[Equipment]] from catching Fire in Scorching Climates.

The following [[Material]]s and [[Armor]] pieces grant Flame Guard in {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}:

